                      {
                          "id":  "4.3",
                          "titulo":  "Contraindicaciones",
                          "html":  "\u003cdiv\u003e\r\n    \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt; letter-spacing:-0.15pt\"\u003eHipersensibilidad conocida al principio activo (mebendazol) o a\u0026nbsp; alguno de los excipientes incluidos en la sección 6.1.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n  \u003c/div\u003e",
                          "vacia":  false
                      },
                      {
                          "id":  "4.5",
                          "titulo":  "InteracciÃ³n con otros medicamentos y otras formas de interacciÃ³n",
                          "html":  "\u003cdiv\u003e\r\n    \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003eSe debe evitar el uso concomitante de mebendazol y metronidazol (ver secci\u0026#243;n 4.4).\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n    \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt;\"\u003e\u0026#xa0;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n    \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003eLa cimetidina podr\u0026#237;a inhibir el metabolismo hep\u0026#225;tico de mebendazol, lo que implicar\u0026#237;a un incremento de los niveles plasm\u0026#225;ticos de este medicamento.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n  \u003c/div\u003e",
                          "vacia":  false
                      },
                      {
                          "id":  "4.6",
                          "titulo":  "Fertilidad, embarazo y lactancia",
                          "html":  "",
                          "vacia":  true
                      },
                      {
                          "id":  "4.8",
                          "titulo":  "Reacciones adversas",
                          "html":  "\u003cdiv\u003e\r\n    \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt;\"\u003eResumen del perfil de seguridad\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n    \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u0026#xa0;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n    \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003eSe ha observado que los pacientes con una expulsi\u0026#243;n elevada de par\u0026#225;sitos han manifestado diarrea y dolor abdominal.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n    \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt;\"\u003e\u0026#xa0;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n    \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003eLa seguridad de mebendazol se ha evaluado en 6.276 pacientes que participaron en 39 ensayos cl\u0026#237;nicos para el tratamiento de parasitosis del tracto gastrointestinal (simples o mixtas). En estos ensayos no se observaron reacciones adversas con una frecuencia\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u0026#8805;1 % en\u0026#160; pacientes tratados con este medicamento.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n    \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u0026#xa0;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n    \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003eEn la tabla 1 se muestran\u0026#160; las reacciones adversas notificadas durante la experiencia postcomercializaci\u0026#243;n, incluyendose tambi\u0026#233;n las reacciones adversas procedentes de ensayos cl\u0026#237;nicos\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:7.33pt; vertical-align:super\"\u003e(*)\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n    \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u0026#xa0;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n    \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003eLas reaccione\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003es adversas al medicamento se clasifican seg\u0026#250;n su frecuencia, usando el siguiente convenio:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n    \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 28.35pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u0026#xa0;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n    \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003eMuy frecuentes (\u0026#8805;1/10)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n    \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003eFrecuentes (\u0026#8805;1/100 a \u0026#60;1/10)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n    \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003ePoco frecuentes (\u0026#8805;1/1.000 a \u0026#60;1/100)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n    \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003eRaras (\u0026#8805;1/10.000 a \u0026#60;1/1.000)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n    \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003eMuy raras (\u0026#60;1/10.000), incluyendo notificaciones\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003eaisladas\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n    \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003eFrecuencia no conocida (no puede estimarse a partir de los datos disponibles)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n    \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 28.35pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt;\"\u003e\u0026#xa0;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n    \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 28.35pt; text-align:center; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt;\"\u003eTabla 1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n    \u003ctable cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse; margin-left:0pt; width:496.1pt\"\u003e\r\n      \u003ctr\u003e\r\n        \u003ctd colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:1pt; border-left-color:#000000; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:1pt; border-right-color:#000000; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:1pt; border-top-color:#000000; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:1pt; padding-left:5.4pt; padding-right:5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:496.1pt\"\u003e\r\n          \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt;\"\u003eTrastornos de la sangre y del sistema linf\u0026#225;tico\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n        \u003c/td\u003e\r\n      \u003c/tr\u003e\r\n\r\n      \u003ctr\u003e\r\n        \u003ctd style=\"border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:1pt; border-left-color:#000000; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:1pt; border-right-color:#000000; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:1pt; border-top-color:#000000; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:1pt; padding-left:5.4pt; padding-right:5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:260.4pt\"\u003e\r\n          \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003eMuy raras\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n        \u003c/td\u003e\r\n\r\n        \u003ctd style=\"border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:1pt; border-left-color:#000000; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:1pt; border-right-color:#000000; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:1pt; border-top-color:#000000; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:1pt; padding-left:5.4pt; padding-right:5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:235.7pt\"\u003e\r\n          \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003eAgranulocitosis (**), Neutropenia\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n        \u003c/td\u003e\r\n      \u003c/tr\u003e\r\n\r\n      \u003ctr\u003e\r\n        \u003ctd colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:1pt; border-left-color:#000000; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:1pt; border-right-color:#000000; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:1pt; border-top-color:#000000; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:1pt; padding-left:5.4pt; padding-right:5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:496.1pt\"\u003e\r\n          \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; page-break-inside:avoid; page-break-after:avoid; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt;\"\u003eTrastornos del sistema inmunol\u0026#243;gico\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n        \u003c/td\u003e\r\n      \u003c/tr\u003e\r\n\r\n      \u003ctr\u003e\r\n        \u003ctd style=\"border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:1pt; border-left-color:#000000; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:1pt; border-right-color:#000000; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:1pt; border-top-color:#000000; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:1pt; padding-left:5.4pt; padding-right:5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:260.4pt\"\u003e\r\n          \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; page-break-inside:avoid; page-break-after:avoid; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003eMuy raras\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n        \u003c/td\u003e\r\n\r\n        \u003ctd style=\"border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:1pt; border-left-color:#000000; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:1pt; border-right-color:#000000; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:1pt; border-top-color:#000000; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:1pt; padding-left:5.4pt; padding-right:5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:235.7pt\"\u003e\r\n          \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003eReacciones de hipersensibilidad como reacciones anafil\u0026#225;cticas y anafilactoides.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n          \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; page-break-inside:avoid; page-break-after:avoid; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u0026#xa0;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n        \u003c/td\u003e\r\n      \u003c/tr\u003e\r\n\r\n      \u003ctr\u003e\r\n        \u003ctd colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:1pt; border-left-color:#000000; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:1pt; border-right-color:#000000; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:1pt; border-top-color:#000000; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:1pt; padding-left:5.4pt; padding-right:5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:496.1pt\"\u003e\r\n          \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt;\"\u003eTrastornos del sistema nervioso\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n        \u003c/td\u003e\r\n      \u003c/tr\u003e\r\n\r\n      \u003ctr\u003e\r\n        \u003ctd style=\"border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:1pt; border-left-color:#000000; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:1pt; border-right-color:#000000; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:1pt; border-top-color:#000000; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:1pt; padding-left:5.4pt; padding-right:5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:260.4pt\"\u003e\r\n          \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003eMuy raras\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n        \u003c/td\u003e\r\n\r\n        \u003ctd style=\"border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:1pt; border-left-color:#000000; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:1pt; border-right-color:#000000; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:1pt; border-top-color:#000000; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:1pt; padding-left:5.4pt; padding-right:5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:235.7pt\"\u003e\r\n          \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003eConvulsiones (ver secci\u0026#243;n 4.4)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n        \u003c/td\u003e\r\n      \u003c/tr\u003e\r\n\r\n      \u003ctr\u003e\r\n        \u003ctd style=\"border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:1pt; border-left-color:#000000; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:1pt; border-right-color:#000000; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:1pt; border-top-color:#000000; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:1pt; padding-left:5.4pt; padding-right:5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:260.4pt\"\u003e\r\n          \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003eRaras\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n        \u003c/td\u003e\r\n\r\n        \u003ctd style=\"border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:1pt; border-left-color:#000000; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:1pt; border-right-color:#000000; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:1pt; border-top-color:#000000; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:1pt; padding-left:5.4pt; padding-right:5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:235.7pt\"\u003e\r\n          \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003eMareo\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n        \u003c/td\u003e\r\n      \u003c/tr\u003e\r\n\r\n      \u003ctr\u003e\r\n        \u003ctd colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:1pt; border-left-color:#000000; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:1pt; border-right-color:#000000; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:1pt; border-top-color:#000000; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:1pt; padding-left:5.4pt; padding-right:5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:496.1pt\"\u003e\r\n          \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt;\"\u003eTrastornos gastrointestinales\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n        \u003c/td\u003e\r\n      \u003c/tr\u003e\r\n\r\n      \u003ctr\u003e\r\n        \u003ctd style=\"border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:1pt; border-left-color:#000000; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:1pt; border-right-color:#000000; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:1pt; border-top-color:#000000; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:1pt; padding-left:5.4pt; padding-right:5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:260.4pt\"\u003e\r\n          \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003eFrecuentes\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n        \u003c/td\u003e\r\n\r\n        \u003ctd style=\"border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:1pt; border-left-color:#000000; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:1pt; border-right-color:#000000; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:1pt; border-top-color:#000000; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:1pt; padding-left:5.4pt; padding-right:5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:235.7pt\"\u003e\r\n          \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003eDolor abdominal\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n        \u003c/td\u003e\r\n      \u003c/tr\u003e\r\n\r\n      \u003ctr\u003e\r\n        \u003ctd style=\"border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:1pt; border-left-color:#000000; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:1pt; border-right-color:#000000; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:1pt; border-top-color:#000000; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:1pt; padding-left:5.4pt; padding-right:5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:260.4pt\"\u003e\r\n          \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003ePoco frecuentes\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n          \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u0026#xa0;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n        \u003c/td\u003e\r\n\r\n        \u003ctd style=\"border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:1pt; border-left-color:#000000; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:1pt; border-right-color:#000000; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:1pt; border-top-color:#000000; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:1pt; padding-left:5.4pt; padding-right:5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:235.7pt\"\u003e\r\n          \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003eMalestar abdominal\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:7.33pt; vertical-align:super\"\u003e(*)\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003e, diarrea\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:7.33pt; vertical-align:super\"\u003e(*)\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003ey flatulencia\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:7.33pt; vertical-align:super\"\u003e(*)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n          \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003e(estos s\u0026#237;ntomas tambi\u0026#233;n pueden ser consecuencia de la infecci\u0026#243;n parasitaria por si misma), n\u0026#225;useas, v\u0026#243;mitos.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n        \u003c/td\u003e\r\n      \u003c/tr\u003e\r\n\r\n      \u003ctr\u003e\r\n        \u003ctd colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:1pt; border-left-color:#000000; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:1pt; border-right-color:#000000; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:1pt; border-top-color:#000000; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:1pt; padding-left:5.4pt; padding-right:5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:496.1pt\"\u003e\r\n          \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt;\"\u003eTrastornos hepatobiliares\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n        \u003c/td\u003e\r\n      \u003c/tr\u003e\r\n\r\n      \u003ctr\u003e\r\n        \u003ctd style=\"border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:1pt; border-left-color:#000000; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:1pt; border-right-color:#000000; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:1pt; border-top-color:#000000; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:1pt; padding-left:5.4pt; padding-right:5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:260.4pt\"\u003e\r\n          \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003eMuy raras\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n        \u003c/td\u003e\r\n\r\n        \u003ctd style=\"border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:1pt; border-left-color:#000000; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:1pt; border-right-color:#000000; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:1pt; border-top-color:#000000; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:1pt; padding-left:5.4pt; padding-right:5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:235.7pt\"\u003e\r\n          \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003eHepatitis y funci\u0026#243;n hep\u0026#225;tica anormal\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n        \u003c/td\u003e\r\n      \u003c/tr\u003e\r\n\r\n      \u003ctr\u003e\r\n        \u003ctd colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:1pt; border-left-color:#000000; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:1pt; border-right-color:#000000; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:1pt; border-top-color:#000000; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:1pt; padding-left:5.4pt; padding-right:5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:496.1pt\"\u003e\r\n          \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt;\"\u003eTrastornos de la piel y del tejido subcut\u0026#225;neo\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n        \u003c/td\u003e\r\n      \u003c/tr\u003e\r\n\r\n      \u003ctr\u003e\r\n        \u003ctd style=\"border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:1pt; border-left-color:#000000; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:1pt; border-right-color:#000000; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:1pt; border-top-color:#000000; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:1pt; padding-left:5.4pt; padding-right:5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:260.4pt\"\u003e\r\n          \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003ePoco frecuentes\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n        \u003c/td\u003e\r\n\r\n        \u003ctd style=\"border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:1pt; border-left-color:#000000; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:1pt; border-right-color:#000000; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:1pt; border-top-color:#000000; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:1pt; padding-left:5.4pt; padding-right:5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:235.7pt\"\u003e\r\n          \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003eErupci\u0026#243;n\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:7.33pt; vertical-align:super\"\u003e(*)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n        \u003c/td\u003e\r\n      \u003c/tr\u003e\r\n\r\n      \u003ctr\u003e\r\n        \u003ctd style=\"border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:1pt; border-left-color:#000000; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:1pt; border-right-color:#000000; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:1pt; border-top-color:#000000; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:1pt; padding-left:5.4pt; padding-right:5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:260.4pt\"\u003e\r\n          \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003eMuy raras\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n          \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u0026#xa0;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n        \u003c/td\u003e\r\n\r\n        \u003ctd style=\"border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:1pt; border-left-color:#000000; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:1pt; border-right-color:#000000; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:1pt; border-top-color:#000000; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:1pt; padding-left:5.4pt; padding-right:5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:235.7pt\"\u003e\r\n          \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003eNecr\u0026#243;lisis epid\u0026#233;rmica t\u0026#243;xica, s\u0026#237;ndrome Stevens-Johnson, exantema, angio-edema, urticaria, alopecia\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n        \u003c/td\u003e\r\n      \u003c/tr\u003e\r\n\r\n      \u003ctr\u003e\r\n        \u003ctd colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:1pt; border-left-color:#000000; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:1pt; border-right-color:#000000; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:1pt; border-top-color:#000000; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:1pt; padding-left:5.4pt; padding-right:5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:496.1pt\"\u003e\r\n          \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt;\"\u003eAlteraciones renales y urinarias\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n        \u003c/td\u003e\r\n      \u003c/tr\u003e\r\n\r\n      \u003ctr\u003e\r\n        \u003ctd style=\"border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:1pt; border-left-color:#000000; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:1pt; border-right-color:#000000; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:1pt; border-top-color:#000000; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:1pt; padding-left:5.4pt; padding-right:5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:260.4pt\"\u003e\r\n          \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003eMuy raras\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n        \u003c/td\u003e\r\n\r\n        \u003ctd style=\"border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:1pt; border-left-color:#000000; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:1pt; border-right-color:#000000; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:1pt; border-top-color:#000000; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:1pt; padding-left:5.4pt; padding-right:5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:235.7pt\"\u003e\r\n          \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003eGlomerulonefritis (**)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n        \u003c/td\u003e\r\n      \u003c/tr\u003e\u003c!--[if !supportMisalignedColumns]\u003e\u003ctr style=\"height:0pt\"\u003e\r\n                                        \u003ctd style=\"width:260.4pt; border:none\"\u003e\r\n                                        \u003c/td\u003e\r\n                                        \u003ctd style=\"width:235.7pt; border:none\"\u003e\r\n                                        \u003c/td\u003e\r\n                                \u003c/tr\u003e\u003c![endif]--\u003e\r\n    \u003c/table\u003e\r\n\r\n    \u003cp style=\"margin:5pt 0pt; background-color:#ffffff\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003e(**) reacciones adversas\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003eobservadas a dosis altas y prolongadas\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n    \u003cp style=\"margin:5pt 0pt; background-color:#ffffff\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt;\"\u003eNotificaci\u0026#243;n de sospechas de reacciones adversas\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n    \u003cp style=\"margin:5pt 0pt; background-color:#ffffff\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003eEs importante notificar sospechas de reacciones adversas al medicamento tras su autorizaci\u0026#243;n. Ello permite una supervisi\u0026#243;n continuada de la relaci\u0026#243;n beneficio/riesgo del medicamento. Se invita a los profesionales sanitarios a notificar las sospechas de reacciones adversas a trav\u0026#233;s del Sistema Espa\u0026#241;ol de Farmacovigilancia de medicamentos de Uso Humano:\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003ehttps://www.notificaram.es.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n  \u003c/div\u003e",
                          "vacia":  false
                      },
                      {
                          "id":  "4.9",
                          "titulo":  "Sobredosis",
                          "html":  "\u003cdiv\u003e\r\n    \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003eEn caso de sobredosis accidental, se pueden producir calambres abdominales, n\u0026#225;useas, v\u0026#243;mitos y diarreas.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n    \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003eCon\u0026#160; dosis sustancialmente superiores a las recomendadas o por periodos de tiempo prolongados se han notificado las siguientes reacciones adversas raramente: alopecia, alteraciones reversibles de la funci\u0026#243;n hep\u0026#225;tica, hepatitis, agranulocitosis, neutropenia y glomerulonefritis. Excepto la agranulocitosis y la glomerulonefritis, estas reacciones adversas, tambi\u0026#233;n fueron notificadas en pacientes tratados con mebendazol a dosis est\u0026#225;ndars.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n    \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt;\"\u003e\u0026#xa0;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n    \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt;\"\u003eTratamiento\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n    \u003cp style=\"margin:0pt; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003eNo hay disponible un ant\u0026#237;doto espec\u0026#237;fico.\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"\u003eSi se considera apropiado puede administrarse carb\u0026#243;n activado.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n  \u003c/div\u003e",
                          "vacia":  false
                      }
                  ]
}